nd":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p049","text":"襄王旣立，立太史氏女爲王后，是爲君王后，生子建。太史敫曰：「女不取媒因自嫁，非吾種也，汙吾世。」終身不睹君王后。君王后賢，不以不睹故失人子之禮。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002815","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"太史氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002778","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"君王后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002778","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002817","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"太史敫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002777","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"君王后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002778","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m049-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"君王后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002778","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p008","text":"初，淖齒之殺湣王也，莒人求湣王子法章，得之太史嬓之家，為人灌園。嬓女憐而善遇之。後法章私以情告女，女遂與通。及莒人共立法章為齊王，以莒距燕，而太史氏女遂為后，所謂「君王后」也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"淖齒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004644","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"湣王","kind":"pers